ge city, doing average things... You start to discover the world for what it truly is... Full of mystery, mythology, creatures, powers, abilities...<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959420/extras/11f4c97993c285e54c2a555fe9be5eb3.webp?t=1728806033\" width=616 height=60 /></span><br>The romance you will experience along the way will be rewarding and have an in-depth storyline. It is up to you if you settle down or check all your options. There are a lot of women in Dragonspire. Some you've known your entire life, some you just met, even some you should never meet. Not everyone will be willing to settle down for a relationship. Make sure you're making the right choices you desire.",
